- this directory contains the skeleton for part 1
  of the simple regex FSM matcher final test

- Files include:

checkregex.[ch]:	Code to check a regex for banned combinations
			- skeleton for you to complete
testcheck.c:		Unit test program for checkregex module
.cbuild:		Custom CB config file to build the unit test
			program and link it with the support library.

- we also depend on ../lib/*, look in there for (eg) regex.h
